# MNIST classification image payloads are local-only by default.
# Keep the directory skeleton, documentation, and deterministic manifests in git;
# keep the bulk copied PNG payloads (source-datasets, thumbnails) out.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*/
!.gitkeep
# Deterministic label manifests are small and regenerable; commit them for the demo.
!manifests/*.csv
!manifests/*.json
!manifests/*.jsonl
